# E-commerce Product System

Backend project that fetches appropriate API

## Reflection
- I made sure variables that needed types to be implemented and interfaces that needed to be defined. Also used OOP 
    principles to create a Product class to display the appropriate data I needed
- Main challenge was understanding how to test the fetch and get specific errors. Had to do some quick research to
    understand how to give in fake data
- I handled it by making sure every async function used await and any function that can fetch errors had a catch response 
    to handle the errors.